  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\nVintage Assay – 1 oz Gold Bar PAMP Suisse Lady Fortuna .9999 Fine\nby\nPAMP\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n4,333.13\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nGold\nWeight\n1 oz Troy Ounces\nPurity\n99.99\nType\nBar\n2 In stock\nQty\nQuantity\nCheck/Wire\nCrypto\nCard/Paypal\n1-9\n1 - 9\n0%\n$\n4,525.14\n$\n4,615.64\n$\n4,751.40\n10-99\n10 - 99\n0.05%\n$\n4,522.88\n$\n4,613.33\n$\n4,749.02\n100+\n100 +\n1%\n$\n4,479.89\n$\n4,569.49\n$\n4,703.88\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nCategories:\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bars\nMint:\nPAMP\nPrice history\nVintage Assay - 1 oz Gold Bar PAMP Suisse Lady Fortuna .9999 Fine was last recorded at $4,509.65 on September 22, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 15.2% and has ranged between $3,893.33 and $5,869.04.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nThis 1 oz Gold Bar from PAMP Suisse features .9999 fine gold quality, making it a trusted choice for collectors and investors alike. Known for their craftsmanship, PAMP Suisse has designed this bar with the famous Lady Fortuna on the obverse side, symbolizing luck and prosperity. The reverse side includes the PAMP Suisse logo, along with the weight, purity, and the “Essayeur Fondeur” mark for authenticity.\nPlease note:\nThe design of the assay card may vary and is provided at random.\nBar Features:\nComposed of .9999 fine gold, weighing 1 troy ounce.\nProduced by PAMP Suisse.\nEnclosed in a protective assay card (non-Veriscan).\nObverse:\nShows Lady Fortuna, the Roman goddess of fortune, depicted with a blindfold representing life’s unpredictability and holding a cornucopia as a symbol of shared wealth.\nReverse:\nDisplays the PAMP Suisse logo, weight, purity, and “Essayeur Fondeur” engraving for verification.\nAdditional information\nMetal\nGold\nProduct Type\nbullion\nIssuer Country\nOther\nIs Legal Tender\nNo\nIs Monetized Bullion\nNo\nPurity %\n99.99\nType of Bullion\nBar\nWeight Unit\nTroy Ounces\nWeight\n1 oz\nRelated products\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bullion\n1 oz PAMP Suisse Gold Bar – Lady Fortuna (Veriscan)\n$\n4,513.10\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\n100 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\n100 Gram Gold Bar – PAMP Suisse(Cast, W/Assay)\n$\n14,684.74\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nGold Bars\n,\nReligious Collection\n1 oz PAMP Suisse – Lakshmi Gold Bar(New w/Assay)\n$\n4,580.30\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n5 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\n5 Gram PAMP Suisse Gold Bar – Lady Fortuna  (In Assay with Veriscan)\n$\n840.25\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\n$\n4,333.13\nAdd to cart\nLogin/Register\nDon't have an account\nRegister\nCustomer Login\nIf you have an account, sign in with your email address.\nContinue with Google\nLoading\nYour Cart\nCart is Empty\nUpdating Cart!\nHowdy,                             Guest\nSign in\nDepartments\nShop\nMints\nCart\nMy Account",
